  "name": "Polycrase Z-Grade",
  "description": "This rich variant of Polycrase ore is especially prized by Caldari engineers for use in large-scale construction projects. Unfortunately, most known deposits of Polycrase Z-Grade are found in the contested space of the Caldari and Gallente warzone. \n\nUnlike regular Polycrase ore, Z-Grade is more stable and can be reprocessed without specialized equipment into <a href=showinfo:36>Mexallon</a> and <a href=showinfo:38>Nocxium</a>.\n\nReprocessing will also produce <a href=showinfo:97513>Aberrant Polycrase</a>. The Caldari State will reward anyone who accepts their campaign objective and delivers this Aberrant material to their item trader outside the Caldari Navy Anchorage in <url=showinfo:5//30045324>Onnamon</url>.",
